flowchart TD
 classDef moment fill:#EAF7EF,stroke:#1F9D55,color:#0c3b22;
 classDef decision fill:#EAF0FF,stroke:#3358CC,color:#10204d;
 classDef gap fill:#FDECEA,stroke:#D7322B,color:#5b1411,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:4;

 A["I come across {{COMPANY}} (ad, peer, post, newsletter, event invite)"]:::moment
 A --> B{"Do I take the first step? (register / RSVP / sign up)"}:::decision
 B -->|Not now| B1["I keep seeing {{COMPANY}} around, no pressure"]
 B1 -.->|later| A
 B -->|Yes| C["I get a clear confirmation + what to expect"]:::moment
 C --> D["I get helpful reminders so I actually show up"]
 D --> E{"Do I show up / engage?"}:::decision
 E -->|No| E1["I get a low-key 'here's what you missed' + an easy way back in"]
 E1 --> G
 E -->|Yes| F["I have a genuinely useful first experience"]:::moment

 F --> G["I'm treated like a person, not a record: follow-up that references what I just did"]:::moment
 G --> H{"Who am I to {{COMPANY}}?"}:::decision
 H -->|High-fit platform engineer Aaron| I["Someone real from {{COMPANY}} reaches out personally about my actual problem"]:::moment
 H -->|Eng leader Hannah| I2["I get role-relevant proof + an invite to the right next step"]:::moment
 H -->|Not a fit right now| F2["I get useful content at a human pace, no spam"]
 F2 -.->|re-engage later| A

 I --> J{"Am I interested enough to have a conversation?"}:::decision
 I2 --> J
 J -->|Not yet| F2
 J -->|Yes| K["I have a conversation about ME, not a generic pitch (discovery)"]:::moment
 K --> L["I see {{COMPANY}} do the thing I care about — and proof it won't drop a page (delivery SLA, logos, case study)"]:::moment
 L --> M{"Do I trust this is real and worth it?"}:::decision
 M -->|I have objections| N["My concerns get answered by someone who actually can"]
 N --> M
 M -->|Yes| O["I get a clear, professional path to yes (proposal / quote)"]:::moment
 O --> P["I become a customer"]:::moment

 P --> Q["I said yes — now what? (handoff to onboarding)"]:::gap
 Q --> R["I get to first value fast (first real service routed)"]:::gap
 R --> R2["If I'm API / Terraform-first: who guides my migration?"]:::gap
 R2 --> S["I keep getting value and expand"]:::gap
 S --> T["I'm happy enough to refer / be a case study"]:::gap
 T -.->|fuels the next buyer's discovery| A
